Get ready to power up!

2
00:05:08,571 --> 00:05:14,571
Barbie Video Game Hero is a animation, family, science
fiction film directed by Ezekiel Norton.

3
00:07:42,857 --> 00:07:48,857
When Barbie is accidentally pulled into her favourite game, she teams up with the roller skater Bella and
her friend Cutie, to stop a mischievous emoji who is trying to take control of the game.

4
00:10:17,142 --> 00:10:23,142
Barbie (voice), played by Erica Lindbeck.

5
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
Teresa / Countdown Clock (voice), played by Sienna Bohn.

6
00:15:25,714 --> 00:15:31,714
Maia / Renee (voice), played by Shannon Chan-Kent.

7
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Cutie / Video Game Narrator (voice), played by Michael Dobson.

8
